        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/donner/{size}/1903_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-28T19:18:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Pfft, this is the internet. &nbsp;If you don't have authenticated video of Christopher when he was making the game giggling to himself as he figures out the name for the card then you have no proof.And if you do have that video it only proves that the conspiracy is larger than we thought.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I suspect Christopher would not giggle. &nbsp;He would instead laugh maniacally. &nbsp;After all, his mission to rule the world by starting a popular game is well on its way.</p>",
