        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Pfft, this is the internet. &nbsp;If you don't have authenticated video of Christopher when he was making the game giggling to himself as he figures out the name for the card then you have no proof.And if you do have that video it only proves that the conspiracy is larger than we thought.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Of course you're right. &nbsp;I can never tell when someone really can't tell the difference between their opinion and actual facts, and when they're just not being clear in a post. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
